WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.760
- Okay, do you have any
plans for Valentine's Day?

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.106
Are you one of those
people that goes all out?

00:00:05.106 --> 00:00:08.620
- We do, we definitely eat a
lot together always, pasta.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.590
- That's like a day the
ends in Y in my house.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:15.233
- Yeah, we'll just binge and drink.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.510
- What are you drinking?

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.023
- Just wine.
- Okay.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:20.940
- Red girl, white girl?

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:21.773
Just curious.

00:00:21.773 --> 00:00:22.606
- Red, for sure.

00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:23.439
- Nice, me too.

00:00:23.439 --> 00:00:24.272
Pinot noir.

00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:25.350
- Pinot noir, yeah.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.420
- I heard something about you though,

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.260
that you've always wanted
to be a mom, right?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.738
- Yes, and we are doing
IVF right now actually.

00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:33.360
(audience cheering)

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.563
- Thanks, thank you.

00:00:34.563 --> 00:00:37.760
- And that's like, it
sounds like just a process

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.110
'cause so many people go through it now.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:39.943
It sounds like a process,

00:00:39.943 --> 00:00:40.776
but it's kinda hardcore.

00:00:40.776 --> 00:00:41.840
I've had friends go through that.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.673
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:42.673 --> 00:00:43.590
So this Valentine's Day,

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.035
I'll be getting shots in
my butt by my husband.

00:00:47.035 --> 00:00:48.210
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.043
- Hormones.

00:00:49.043 --> 00:00:49.930
- Very romantic.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.080
Yes, hormones.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.750
But the hormones are very intense.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.654
And you know, so many
people, they go through this.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:56.670
- [Kelly] So many.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.830
- And we don't talk about
it enough, I think, as women

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:03.410
and we need to raise more understanding

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.243
and awareness behind it.

00:01:04.243 --> 00:01:05.350
- And I'm glad, that's why I was so happy

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:06.410
you wanted to talk about this today

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.130
because I have friends who went through it

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.590
and I mean, went through
some serious depression,

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.090
felt shame, was like
"What was wrong with me?"

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.010
Like, tried everything under the sun.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:17.090
And sometimes, it just doesn't happen

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.380
and you just need science to
kind of help move it along.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.730
- Yeah, and it's actually such
a miracle what they can do.

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:24.835
Like, that's a miracle in of itself.

00:01:24.835 --> 00:01:26.260
- Agreed.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.010
Did you always picture
yourself being a mom?

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.530
- Yeah, definitely.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.050
- You're the baby of the family
and you always wanted kids?

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.290
We're like, opposite humans.

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.810
- No, I'm the older sister,

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.334
- Oh, you're the old.. that makes sense.

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:37.167
Okay.

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:38.742
- But I had a little baby
carriage that I would,

00:01:38.742 --> 00:01:39.580
you know, and a baby doll.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.260
- That was my sister and
then she'd curl my hair

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:42.093
and accidentally burn me.

00:01:42.093 --> 00:01:42.926
It was fine.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.349
- Yeah, I cut my sister's bangs a lot.

00:01:45.349 --> 00:01:47.353
- Yeah, that's what my sister would do.

